{% render 'async-stylesheet', file: 'faq-faq.css' %}
<script src="{{ 'faq-faq.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
<section class="faq">
    <div class="container">

        <span class="faq__label gray-badge">
            MORE QUESTIONS
        </span>

        <div class="faq__items">

            <article class="faq-item faq-item--active">

                <button class="faq-item__button" type="button" aria-expanded="true">
                    <h3 class="faq-item__title">
                        Can I take Api-Complex while pregnant <br class="mobile-br"> or breastfeeding?
                    </h3>

                    <span class="faq-item__icon">

                        <svg id="minus-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                            <path d="M5.5 12.75V11.25H18.5V12.75H5.5Z" fill="currentColor" />
                        </svg>


                        <svg id="plus-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                            <path d="M11.25 12.75H5.5V11.25H11.25V5.5H12.75V11.25H18.5V12.75H12.75V18.5H11.25V12.75Z"
                                fill="currentColor" />
                        </svg>

                    </span>
                </button>

                <div class="faq-item__content">
                    <p>
                        Consult your healthcare provider before use.
                        Hive compounds <br class="mobile-br"> have not been studied enough in pregnancy or breastfeeding for us to recommend use. We recommend erring on the side of caution.

                    </p>
                </div>

            </article>

            <article class="faq-item">

                <button class="faq-item__button" type="button" aria-expanded="true">
                    <h3 class="faq-item__title">
                        Can I take Api-Complex with <br class="mobile-br"> other supplements or medications?
                    </h3>

                    <span class="faq-item__icon">

                        <svg id="minus-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                            <path d="M5.5 12.75V11.25H18.5V12.75H5.5Z" fill="currentColor" />
                        </svg>

                        <svg id="plus-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                            <path d="M11.25 12.75H5.5V11.25H11.25V5.5H12.75V11.25H18.5V12.75H12.75V18.5H11.25V12.75Z"
                                fill="currentColor" />
                        </svg>

                    </span>
                </button>

                <div class="faq-item__content">
                    <p>
                        Api-Complex contains no synthetic compounds, but propolis and royal jelly may interact with blood thinners or medications that affect the immune system. If you take prescription medication, consult your physician.

                    </p>
                </div>

            </article>

            <article class="faq-item">

                <button class="faq-item__button" type="button" aria-expanded="true">
                    <h3 class="faq-item__title">
                        When should I expect to feel a difference?
                    </h3>

                    <span class="faq-item__icon">

                        <svg id="minus-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                            <path d="M5.5 12.75V11.25H18.5V12.75H5.5Z" fill="currentColor" />
                        </svg>


                        <svg id="plus-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                            <path d="M11.25 12.75H5.5V11.25H11.25V5.5H12.75V11.25H18.5V12.75H12.75V18.5H11.25V12.75Z"
                                fill="currentColor" />
                        </svg>

                    </span>
                </button>

                <div class="faq-item__content">
                    <p>
                        Some people notice subtle changes early on, often around digestion or steadier energy. Others take longer. Experience varies with sleep, stress, diet, and routine. Individual results vary.
                    </p>
                </div>

            </article>

            <article class="faq-item">

                <button class="faq-item__button" type="button" aria-expanded="true">
                    <h3 class="faq-item__title">
                        Can I take more than one stick per day?
                    </h3>

                    <span class="faq-item__icon">

                        <svg id="minus-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                            <path d="M5.5 12.75V11.25H18.5V12.75H5.5Z" fill="currentColor" />
                        </svg>


                        <svg id="plus-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                            <path d="M11.25 12.75H5.5V11.25H11.25V5.5H12.75V11.25H18.5V12.75H12.75V18.5H11.25V12.75Z"
                                fill="currentColor" />
                        </svg>

                    </span>
                </button>

                <div class="faq-item__content">
                    <p>
                        One stick per day is the intended protocol.
                        The dosages are designed for daily cumulative
                        effect — more is not more here.
                        Respect the design.
                    </p>
                </div>

            </article>

            <article class="faq-item">

                <button class="faq-item__button" type="button" aria-expanded="true">
                    <h3 class="faq-item__title">
                        What happens if I miss a day?
                    </h3>

                    <span class="faq-item__icon">

                        <svg id="minus-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                            <path d="M5.5 12.75V11.25H18.5V12.75H5.5Z" fill="currentColor" />
                        </svg>

                        <svg id="plus-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                            <path d="M11.25 12.75H5.5V11.25H11.25V5.5H12.75V11.25H18.5V12.75H12.75V18.5H11.25V12.75Z"
                                fill="currentColor" />
                        </svg>

                    </span>
                </button>

                <div class="faq-item__content">
                    <p>
                        Nothing dramatic. Bioactive compounds build
                        cumulatively. One missed day does not reset
                        the protocol. <br> Do not double-dose to compensate —
                        simply continue the <br class="mobile-br"> next morning.
                    </p>
                </div>

            </article>

        </div>

    </div>
</section>


